    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i messed up and poked my leg pretty deep with an old rusty trowel while i was working in the garden. it’s bleeding a bit but it looks okay. i dont really have time to go to the dr right now cuz i gotta finish this project, so how can i just clean it out and seal it up real good at home so it doesnt get infected? thanks",
