    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay okay i hear you. i'll skip the glue. if i cant make it to the clinic today, what's the best way to clean the inside of the hole so it's actually sterile? can i just pour some peroxide or alcohol in there to kill everything? i really need to make sure it's clean so i don't have to deal with this later.",
